rashomon demo 1: one Claude Code session, three turns, each hook line run as installed.
Masked: <tmp> is the run's scratch directory, <install> its install id, <generated> the report's clock; the binary prints as rashomon.

setup: rashomon watch --yes (exit 0; its screen went to a log, as --yes means)
setup: the eight lines it installed in settings.json, one per event:
  PreToolUse          rashomon hook --install <install>
  PostToolUse         rashomon post --install <install>
  PostToolUseFailure  rashomon post --install <install>
  SessionStart        rashomon probe start --install <install>
  SessionEnd          rashomon probe end --install <install>
  Stop                rashomon recap --install <install>
  StopFailure         rashomon recap --install <install>
  UserPromptSubmit    rashomon recap pending --install <install>

